    "narrative": "The meseta is where most pilgrims break open. The landscape offers nothing to look at, nowhere to hide, no distraction. Your mind runs out of things to think about. What remains is what you came here to find. The ruins of San Antón monastery appear like a mirage — a reminder that others have walked this emptiness for centuries.",
